{"availability":"available","full":"znamirovsky/eduai-navigator","name":"eduai-navigator","description":"🏆 1st place – Regional AI Olympiad 2026: A high-performance web app featuring a multidimensional (6D) spatial recommendation algorithm for secondary school selection in the Karlovy Vary Region. Built with JavaScript and SheetJS for zero-backend client-side data processing.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-22T21:09:50Z","updated":"2026-09-03T06:32:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://znamirovsky.github.io/eduai-navigator/","topics":["ai","ai-olympiad","education","javascript","recommendation-system","secondary-school","sheetjs","webapp"],"demo":"https://znamirovsky.github.io/eduai-navigator/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:23.961Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:23.961Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:24:23.961Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:23.961Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🏆 1st Place Winner – Regional Round of the AI Olympiad 2026 (Karlovy Vary Region) 🌐 👉 Try Live Demo Team: Dva a ten Jeden Development Time Limit: 4 hours Development Methodology: Vibe coding with Gemini 3.5","EduAI Navigator is an intelligent recommendation platform designed to connect student talent with the future economic and labor needs of the Karlovy Vary Region.","The application solves the challenge of inefficient secondary school selection by considering student preferences alongside regional strategic priorities, such as local industry demand and the risk of brain drain."],"features":["6D Student Profiling: Dynamic sliders for interest in tech, working with people, manual crafts, computers, creativity, and theoretical vs. practical focus.","Regional Priority Adjustments: Custom weighting sliders to prioritize local employer demand and mitigate brain drain risks.","Vector Match Algorithm: Calculates 6D Euclidean distan